# ── Phase D — Platform Designer / Nios V generated artifacts ───────────────
# Source kept in git: soc/*.qsys, soc/{niosv,jtag,soc}_top.v/.sdc, soc/ecg_core_hw.tcl,
# soc/core_pll.v, sw/niosv/{main.c,ecg_samples.h}, testbench/tb_niosv_system.v,
# testbench/run_tb_niosv.do. Everything below is regenerated (Generate HDL / niosv-bsp).
# Qsys-generated systems (regenerate: open .qsys in Platform Designer -> Generate HDL)
hardware/fpga/soc/nios_system/
hardware/fpga/soc/jtag_system/
